<title>USA: Dyna Group International Q1 loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Dyna Group International Q1 loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>BROADVIEW, Ill. 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			  1996</p>
<p> Sales				 2,487			 2,273</p>
<p> Pretax profit (loss)		(9)			 (107)</p>
<p> Net profit (loss)		   (6)		     (66)(a)</p>
<p> Earnings per share		  .00			 (.01)</p>
<p>Weighted average</p>
<p>  shares outstanding	 7,494,175		   7,469,592</p>
<p>	  (In thousands except per share amounts)</p>
<p>(a) NOTE: During the 1996 fourth quarter, the company recorded a book-to-physical inventory adjustment. The financial statements for the quarter ended March 31, 1996, have been restated to reflect the impact of this adjustment. Accordingly, first quarter 1996 pretax earnings have been reduced by $195,000, and net income has been reduced by $121,000.  This restated profit level of 1996 reflects actual activity at that time and is comparable with 1997 as no similar adjustments are being made in 1997.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
</text>
